# DIAGNOSTICS

Each step names itself in its message: `mkbootfs: bad entry <arg> (want name=file)`, `elf2efi: <file>: <reason>`, `qemu-monitor: can't connect to <socket>`.
`vx` exits 1 after any of them.

# BUGS

`qemu-monitor` sends its command and reads to the next prompt; a command whose reply contains the text `(qemu) ` ends the read early.
